  "summary": "Diff/Patch Frontend",
  "description": "KDiff3 is a file and folder diff and merge tool which\n- compares and merges two or three text input files or folders,\n- shows the differences line by line and character by character(!),\n- provides an automatic merge-facility,\n- has an editor for comfortable solving of merge-conflicts,\n- provides network transparency via KIO,\n- has options to highlight or hide changes in white-space or comments,\n- supports Unicode, UTF-8 and other file encodings,\n- prints differences,\n- supports version control keyword and history merging.",
  "tags": [
    "compare",
    "diff",
    "file",
    "folder",
    "merge",
    "patch"
  ],
